From 6cbbb4b1284dd0fa066afa73451a0d2911a9a44b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:21:14 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Add persistent Chromium client and native release launchers

Reuse the multi-tab callback lifetime implementation, retain timed diagnostic clients, parse host options independently, and include native icon metadata. Add opt-in per-child file evidence because serial records can interleave. Both architectures cross-link; interactive and ledger runtime qualification remains pending.
